# GameManager — Game Registry & Dispatcher
# Files: src/coordinator/GameManager.h, GameManager.cpp

## PURPOSE
Registers all 29 games as global instances, dispatches startGame(id), routes puck events.

## API
- begin(): calls StatsManager::begin()
- update(): calls currentGame->loop() if game active
- startGame(gameID): switch-case 1-29, calls StatsManager::addGameStart() + startPlaytime(), then game->setup()
- getCurrentGame(): returns Game* pointer for WebHandler
- handlePuckEvent(mac, event): finds puckIndex by MAC, calls currentGame->handleEvent()

## GAME ID REGISTRY
1=ShuttleRun, 2=SimpleCounter, 3=SimpleCountdown, 4=SimonSays, 5=DisplayMode,
6=SimonRuns, 7=SortingHat, 8=BombSquad, 9=RedGreen, 10=Stopwatch,
11=Zombie, 12=BeepTest, 13=React2P, 14=TTest, 15=Target,
16=Timer, 17=Hunt, 18=Pacemaker, 19=Memory, 20=Domination,
21=CTL, 22=Tabata, 23=Ball, 24=Whac, 25=CatReflex,
26=Musical, 27=TTTT, 28=Pitstop, 29=Custom

## RAM WATCHDOG
Tracks lowestHeapValue and lowestHeapGameId after each game switch.
Exposed as extern globals for WebHandler /api/sysinfo.

## ADDING A NEW GAME
1. Create Game_NewGame.h/cpp inheriting Game
2. #include in GameManager.cpp
3. Add global instance: Game_NewGame gameNewGame; // ID N
4. Add case N in switch
5. Update StatsManager bounds (gameStarts array size, loop limits)
6. Add tile in data/index.html
7. Create setup/run HTML pages
